Um... oh gosh, this is... a bit much, isn't it? Talking about feelings...

(Takes a deep breath)

Okay... um... there was... there was this one time. It was... a few years ago. We... we did a community garden project at my... at my library. Just, like, planting flowers and stuff.

(Looks up briefly, then back down)

It wasn't... it wasn't anything *big*. But... there were a lot of people there. All ages, you know? And... and we were all just... working together. Like, pulling weeds and... and laughing a little. Not... not loud laughing, mostly just... quiet smiles.

(Shrugs a little)

I usually... I usually don't say much. But... I helped this little girl plant a sunflower. And she kept asking me questions, like, "Will it be tall? Will the birds like it?" And... and I actually *answered* her. And... and she seemed really happy. 

(A small, almost imperceptible smile)

